<title>USA: Provident American Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Provident American Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NORRISTOWN, Pa. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(000s omitted)</p>
<p>					 Three Months     Nine Months</p>
<p>			   Ended September 30,  Ended September 30,</p>
<p>				    1996    1995	  1996     1995</p>
<p> Premiums earned	   $18,018 $13,238     $49,238  $39,086</p>
<p>  Net investment income    1,577     688	 3,086    2,277</p>
<p>  Other income		   434     271	23,286	848</p>
<p>  Gross revenue	     20,029  14,197	75,610   42,211</p>
