<p>  Net revenue		 13,042   9,588	59,629   29,542</p>
<p>  Net income (loss)	    783   (685)	15,180  (1,724)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per</p>
<p>   share of common stock    0.07  ( 0.08)	 1.38  ( 0.22)</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	11,279  9,098*	1O,889   9,096*</p>
<p>NOTE - * Restated for shares issued related to the acquisition of REF accounted for as a &quot;pooling of interests.&quot;</p>
<p>Q3 1996 includes after-tax gain of $484,000 on the sale of securities from its investment portfolio.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
